NC Digital creates professional logos and brand identities for businesses in Port Talbot and across Neath Port Talbot. Every logo is designed by hand — no AI, no templates — and delivered in every format you'll ever need.

## Why branding matters for Port Talbot businesses

Local customers make quick judgements. A professional logo signals that you're credible, established, and serious about your business. It's the foundation of everything else — your website, your uniforms, your van, your social media presence — and getting it right from the start means you don't have to redo it in two years.

We work with businesses across Port Talbot and the surrounding area, creating logos that are distinctive, scalable, and built to last.

## What's included

- 5 initial logo concepts
- Revisions until you're completely satisfied
